{"session_id": "20260907T072123Z-d7f33b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:24:26+00:00", "language": "ta", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "Are there any welfare schemes for sugarcane farmers?", "translated_query": "Are there any welfare schemes for sugarcane farmers?", "answer": "ஆம், கரும்பு விவசாயிகளுக்கான நலத்திட்டங்கள் உள்ளன. அவற்றில் Sustainable Sugarcane Initiative மற்றும் Production Incentive to cane growers ஆகியவை அடங்கும். கரும்பு வளரும் பகுதிகளில் Seed-cane hubs உருவாக்குதல் மற்றும் Raton Management Demonstration போன்ற உதவிகளும் வழங்கப்படுகின்றன. மேலும் விவரங்களுக்கு, இந்த குறிப்பிட்ட திட்டங்கள் குறித்து நீங்கள் விசாரிக்கலாம்.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0000", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.24493129398384064}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0042", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "PM-KISAN", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.16611550391487181}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0309", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 63, "rerank_score": 0.09164033592073614}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0008", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.06550655988721076}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0297", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": "Minimum Support Price", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchite